# Omni - dolphin (actions/dolphin/dolphin_omni.kbd)
**omni + spc**      -- Select
**omni + ent**      -- Preview
**omni + bcsp**     -- Bcsp
**omni + a**        -- Select All
**omni + lsft + a** -- Invert Selection
**omni + rsft + a** -- Invert Selection
**omni + c**        -- Copy
**omni + lsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + rsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + c + h**    -- Copy To Other Pane
**omni + c + l**    -- Copy To Other Pane
**omni + d**        -- Duplicate
**omni + e**        -- Extract
**omni + lsft + e** -- Compress
**omni + g**        -- Go
**omni + i**        -- Info
**omni + n**        -- New
**omni + lsft + n** -- New Folder
**omni + rsft + n** -- New Window
**omni + o**        -- Open
**omni + p**        -- Parent
**omni + r**        -- Rename
**omni + s**        -- Toggle Sort By
**omni + lsft + s** -- Sort Order Toggle
**omni + t**        -- New Tab
**omni + lsft + t** -- Undo Tab
**omni + u**        -- Cycle View
**omni + v**        -- Paste
**omni + w**        -- Close Tab
**omni + x**        -- Cut
**omni + x + h**    -- Move To Other Pane
**omni + x + l**    -- Move To Other Pane
**omni + z**        -- Undo
**omni + lsft + z** -- Redo
**omni + 0**        -- Zoom Reset
**omni + 1**        -- Tab 1
**omni + 2**        -- Tab 2
**omni + 3**        -- Tab 3
**omni + 4**        -- Tab 4
**omni + 5**        -- Tab 5
**omni + 6**        -- Tab 6
**omni + 7**        -- Tab 7
**omni + 8**        -- Tab 8
**omni + 9**        -- Tab 9
**omni + -**        -- Zoomout
**omni + =**        -- Zoomin
**omni + ]**        -- Forward
**omni + [**        -- Back
**omni + \**        -- Vimdiff
**omni + '**        -- Filter
**omni + .**        -- Tags
